<div>
  <h2>The Impact</h2>
  <p>
    Across six events, the campaign earned 21.1M+ impressions and 22.9M minutes
    watched on Twitch broadcasts and player streams, a 160% year-over-year
    increase for the Guard. ImperialHal, iiTzTimmy, Summit1G and Sweet also
    engaged with the event on their own channels, which spread the Guard's
    message beyond its own.
  </p>
</div>

